    "description": "Add `parseDuration(text)` in `src/duration.mjs` as a named export. It parses strings such as `1h30m15s` into a number of seconds: units are `h` (3600 s), `m` (60 s) and `s` (1 s), any subset may appear, always in that order. A malformed or empty string throws a TypeError.",
    "steps": [
      "Create src/duration.mjs exporting parseDuration",
      "Add tests in test/duration.test.mjs"
    ],
    "verificationCriteria": [
